    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from an anchor of 0.65, each explicit factor update applied downward modestly; combined effect yields ~0.55 probability with a middling confidence range. The synthesis accounts for potential calibration bias toward the anchor and acknowledges persistent uncertainty due to turnout and electoral mechanics (MMP) that could mitigate CDU's margin."
  }
}
